{"quest_id": 7167, "name": "彼方からの報せ", "description": "天界との戦いに備え、物質界を見回る\n王子の前に追手から逃げる鳥人の少女が\n現れる。少女を追う天使たちを迎撃せよ！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "集うは神の聖域", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920152, "map_no": 5760, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2500, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105536, "race_id": 6, "change_to": 1, "master_id": 656, "global_id": 655, "to_condition": 0, "to_global_id": 648, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 3000}]}, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2500, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 121, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105456, "race_id": 6, "missile_id": 149, "missile": {"speed": 3.0}, "master_id": 649, "global_id": 648, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 0}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 24, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 30, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2105520, "race_id": 6, "change_to": 3, "master_id": 655, "global_id": 654, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 100}]}, "spawn_sec": 5}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 75}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 85}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 90}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 94}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 216, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2107392, "race_id": 6, "change_to": 9, "master_id": 573, "global_id": 572, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 30}]}, "spawn_sec": 102}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "（――物語は、いつも夢を見せてくれる）", "face": "lfd3227fb291f"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "（あの人もそうだった、人に夢を持たせる人だった。\n英雄王と呼ばれるようになった、あの人も）", "face": "lfd3227fb291f"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "（けれど、現実はそうじゃない。\n私はもっと早く、それに気付くべきだった。\n――そして王子、あなたも）", "face": "lfd3227fb291f"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………？", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アーニャ", "text": "王子さま、どうかしましたか？\nなんだかぼーっとしてましたけど……。", "face": "u99"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "連日の遠征に見回りにと、\n王子もお疲れなのかもしれませんね。\n少し休暇をとってはいかがでしょう？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そうですね、天界の拠点、物質界の警備を\n物質界連合軍で分担しているとはいえ、\n王子でなければできない判断が多すぎますから。", "face": "lbdf27d88a854"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（ふるふる）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "鳶翼", "text": "殿下は意固地ですなぁ。\nここは無理矢理にでも休暇を――むっ？", "face": "u1093a1"}, {"name": "アーニャ", "text": "もう、エンヨクさんまで\nいったいどうしたんですか？\n何か聞こえたりしました？", "face": "u99"}, {"name": "鳶翼", "text": "えぇ、聞こえましたとも。\nこの風切りの音は……。\nまずい……殿下、何者かが急降下してきます！", "face": "u1093a1"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "――あぁもうっ！　しつこいですわね！！\n天使にかまってる暇なんてありませんのよ！！", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "もうすぐ地上だというのに……。\nって、あっ！　あそこに見えるのは、\nもしかして王国軍ではありませんの！？", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "伝令ー！　伝令ですわよー！！\n伝令ですけれど、その前に助けてくださいな～！！", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "あれは……鳥人さん、ですか？", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "た、大変ですよ！\n天使に追われています！！", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、まずはあの方を助けるのが先決です。\n急ぎ天使たちを迎撃しましょう！", "face": "l026c15110180"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "はぁ……はぁ……助かりましたわ……。\n天界の門からずっと追われていて、\nもう駄目かと思ってましたの……。", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "鳶翼", "text": "オーキュ、何があったのですか。\nあなたは「聖域」の調査に出ていたはずですが……。", "face": "u1093a1"}, {"name": "オーキュ", "text": "あら、エンヨクさん！\nふふふ、そうなのです。\n「聖域」ですごいものを見つけちゃったのですわ！", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "アーニャ", "text": "せーいき？", "face": "u99"}, {"name": "オーキュ", "text": "かつて神々が天界にいた頃、\n居城としていた領域のことを「聖域」と呼ぶのです。", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "オーキュ", "text": "私はその盗掘――コホン、\n発掘をしていたのですけれど、\nすごいものを見つけちゃったのですわよ……！", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "オーキュ", "text": "そう「神の楔」です！！", "face": "u1101a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……どうやら、王子の休暇は\nしばらくお預けになりそうですね。", "face": "lbdf27d88a854"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "この近くに王国軍の砦があります。\nオーキュさんの話はそこで聞きましょうか。"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920152_5760", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 947, "y": 314}, {"k": "m", "x": 848, "y": 324, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 781, "y": 373, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 709, "y": 416, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 620, "y": 448, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 428, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 438, "y": 385, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 346, "y": 340, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 280, "y": 286, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 307, "y": 213, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 378, "y": 178, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 452, "y": 149, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 536, "y": 146, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 621, "y": 183, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 701, "y": 227, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 776, "y": 275, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 222, "y": 161, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 245, "y": 384, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 126, "y": 141, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 148, "y": 418, "id": 218}, {"k": "r", "x": 363, "y": 407, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 455, "y": 91, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 715, "y": 494, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 847, "y": 417, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 851, "y": 231, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 596, "y": 89, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 802, "y": 201, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 481, "y": 476, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 635, "y": 388, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 483, "y": 200, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 558, "y": 210, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 555, "y": 384, "id": 311}, {"k": "r", "x": 173, "y": 352, "id": 312}, {"k": "r", "x": 168, "y": 211, "id": 313}, {"k": "r", "x": 109, "y": 249, "id": 314}]}, "active": true}